    "DialogTitle": "Gildor 8 quest yes",
    "PreviousBlocks": 1b,
    "DialogText": "I would send you there, to speak with Barin, a young prince of the Iron Hills. The Dwarves do not part easily with secrets, but if this is true, we face a danger as great as the One Ring itself. If Morgoth’s light has been found once more, it could awaken things better left undisturbed.

Go, find this dwarf in the West Peak of the Iron Hills. Barin is not as hardened as his elders and may lend a more sympathetic ear. His curiosity might lead him to reveal more about the artifact than others would. But tread carefully... few who seek the Silmarils find joy in their end. The Silmarils are objects of both beauty and doom, and even Barin might struggle with the power of such a jewel. Help him make the right choice, should you find him. Come back to me after that.",
